type: dataset
title: "Math Formulas Dataset"
abstract: >-
  An open, machine-readable dataset of math formulas covering algebra, calculus,
  trigonometry, statistics and fractions, each with LaTeX, variable definitions,
  a computable expression, verified worked examples and links to full lessons on Mathovia.
